    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Slowest statements",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "`pg_stat_statements` is not a metric, so this is a query, not a panel. Run the two queries of `docs/6-observability.md` section 14.2 as `qp_monitor`: the twenty statements that cost the most in total, and the paged read `listSessions` issues over `execution.session` (O20).\n\n```\npsql \"postgres://qp_monitor:$QP_MONITOR_PASSWORD@localhost:${POSTGRES_PORT:-5432}/$POSTGRES_DB\"\n```\n\nRead `mean_ms` against `max_ms` before `total_ms`: the counts run from the server's start or the last reset."
      },
      "id": 14,
      "gridPos": {
